ZLT-NT aircraft package

This package incorporates the FlightGear/JSBSim Zeppelin NT-07 airship flight
model by Anders Gidenstam (Copyright (C) 2008-2023).

Original upstream model: FlightGear / JSBSim, aircraft "ZLT-NT".
The upstream model declares GPL-2.0-or-later; see LICENSE and the retained
copyright headers in ZLT-NT.xml and Systems/.

PteroSim-specific work in this package consists of the Visual.xml layout,
converted GLB meshes, PteroSim Drive bindings, and integration adjustments.
